{"seq":3,"slug":"results-discussion","title":"研究生 学术写作 — 结果与讨论撰写","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/paper-structure/results-discussion","wordCount":1392,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"研究生-学术写作-结果与讨论撰写\">研究生 学术写作 — 结果与讨论撰写</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>结果（Results）和讨论（Discussion）是论文中展示你的发现并赋予其意义的核心部分。结果章回答&quot;发现了什么&quot;，讨论章回答&quot;这意味着什么&quot;。两者的分工必须清晰：结果章只呈现客观发现，不加解释；讨论章在结果基础上进行理论分析和实践推断。</p>\n<p>很多研究生在写结果章时犯的最大错误是把数据和解释混在一起；在写讨论章时犯的最大错误是简单重复结果而缺乏深度分析。理解这两部分的功能差异和写作策略，是提升论文质量的关键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"结果章的写作\">结果章的写作</h3><h4 id=\"量化结果的呈现顺序\">量化结果的呈现顺序</h4><p>量化研究的结果通常按以下顺序组织：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[数据清洗说明] --&gt; B[描述性统计]&#10;    B --&gt; C[测量模型检验]&#10;    C --&gt; D[假设检验]&#10;    D --&gt; E[附加分析]\">graph TD\n    A[数据清洗说明] --&gt; B[描述性统计]\n    B --&gt; C[测量模型检验]\n    C --&gt; D[假设检验]\n    D --&gt; E[附加分析]</pre><p><strong>描述性统计</strong>：报告各变量的均值（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span>）、标准差（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span>）和变量间的相关矩阵。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>变量</th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>D</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SD</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span></span></span></span></span></th>\n<th>1</th>\n<th>2</th>\n<th>3</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1. 工作满意度</td>\n<td>4.82</td>\n<td>1.23</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2. 组织承诺</td>\n<td>5.01</td>\n<td>0.98</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>.45</mn><mrow><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">.45^{**}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">.4</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3. 离职意向</td>\n<td>2.34</td>\n<td>1.45</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>.38</mn><mrow><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-.38^{**}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.772em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">.3</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">8</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>.52</mn><mrow><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-.52^{**}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.772em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">.5</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>注：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mrow></mrow><mrow><mo>∗</mo><mo>∗</mo></mrow></msup><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>.01</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">^{**}p &lt; .01</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8831em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">∗∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">.01</span></span></span></span></span></p>\n<p><strong>假设检验结果</strong>的报告格式（以回归为例）：\n&quot;工作满意度对离职意向有显著的负向影响（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>0.32</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta = -0.32</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">0.32</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>5.47</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t = -5.47</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">5.47</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>.001</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p &lt; .001</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7335em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">.001</span></span></span></span></span>），假设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 得到支持。&quot;</p>\n<h4 id=\"质性结果的呈现策略\">质性结果的呈现策略</h4><p>质性结果通常按主题（theme）组织：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>一级主题</th>\n<th>二级主题</th>\n<th>代表性引语</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>角色冲突</td>\n<td>工作-家庭冲突</td>\n<td>&quot;P03：在家办公时孩子经常打断我&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>时间边界模糊</td>\n<td>&quot;P07：下班时间变得不确定&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自我调适</td>\n<td>空间仪式感</td>\n<td>&quot;P11：我专门布置了一个工作角&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>引语使用原则</strong>：每个主题配2-3条代表性引语，标注参与者编号（P01, P02...），必要时可适当缩减引语长度用[...]标注省略。</p>\n<h4 id=\"结果章的常见错误\">结果章的常见错误</h4><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>错误</th>\n<th>正确做法</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>在结果章中进行解释和讨论</td>\n<td>仅报告发现，讨论放到下一章</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>只报告显著结果</td>\n<td>不显著的结果也必须报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>用表格+文字重复同一信息</td>\n<td>表格展示详细数据，文字突出关键发现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>表格没有标题和注释</td>\n<td>每个表格都需要描述性标题和统计注释</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据精度不一致</td>\n<td>统一到小数点后两位</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"讨论章的写作\">讨论章的写作</h3><h4 id=\"讨论的基本结构\">讨论的基本结构</h4><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>部分</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>篇幅</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主要发现总结</td>\n<td>用2-3段回顾核心结果</td>\n<td>10-15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>与文献对话</td>\n<td>与已有研究比较分析</td>\n<td>50-60%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>理论贡献</td>\n<td>阐明对理论的推进</td>\n<td>10-15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>实践意义</td>\n<td>对实践者的建议</td>\n<td>10-15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>研究局限</td>\n<td>方法论限制的诚实讨论</td>\n<td>5-10%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>未来方向</td>\n<td>后续研究建议</td>\n<td>5%</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h4 id=\"与文献对话的策略\">与文献对话的策略</h4><p>这是讨论章最核心也最有深度的部分。基本模式：</p>\n<p><strong>一致性讨论</strong>：&quot;本研究发现X正向影响Y，这与Smith（2020）和Jones（2021）的研究结论一致。可能的解释是……&quot;</p>\n<p><strong>矛盾性讨论</strong>：&quot;与预期不同，本研究未发现X对Y的显著影响。这一发现与Wang（2019）的结论矛盾。可能的原因包括：(1) 样本特征差异；(2) 测量工具差异；(3) 文化背景差异……&quot;</p>\n<p><strong>意外发现</strong>：&quot;一个值得注意的意外发现是……这可能暗示了一个此前被忽视的机制，即……&quot;</p>\n<h4 id=\"讨论中的深度分析技巧\">讨论中的深度分析技巧</h4><ul>\n<li><strong>提供机制解释</strong>：不仅说&quot;X影响Y&quot;，还要解释&quot;为什么X会影响Y&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>探讨边界条件</strong>：这个关系在什么条件下可能更强/更弱？</li>\n<li><strong>建立理论联系</strong>：你的发现如何丰富或修正了你使用的理论框架？</li>\n<li><strong>承认复杂性</strong>：避免过度简化，承认现象的多面性</li>\n</ul>\n<h4 id=\"研究局限的写作\">研究局限的写作</h4><p>诚实讨论局限不是弱点，而是学术成熟的标志。推荐策略：列出2-4个主要局限，对每个说明(1)它是什么；(2)它可能如何影响结论；(3)未来研究如何改进。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li><p><strong>结果呈现练习</strong>：找一篇量化研究论文的结果章，评估它是否遵循了&quot;描述性统计→测量模型→假设检验&quot;的顺序。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>讨论深度分析</strong>：选择一篇论文的讨论部分，判断它属于&quot;浅层讨论&quot;还是&quot;深层讨论&quot;。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>不显著结果讨论</strong>：假设你的假设 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H_3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0813em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 未获支持（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.08</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\beta = 0.08</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0528em;\">β</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.08</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>.23</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p = .23</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">.23</span></span></span></span></span>），请写一段200字的讨论分析可能原因。</p>\n</li>\n<li><p><strong>局限性写作</strong>：为你的研究列出3个主要局限，按推荐策略写出完整的局限性段落。</p>\n</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Hess, D. R. (2004)</strong>. How to write an effective discussion. <em>Respiratory Care</em>, 49(10), 1238-1241.</li>\n<li><strong>Docherty, M., &amp; Smith, R. (1999)</strong>. The case for structuring the discussion. <em>BMJ</em>, 318(7193), 1224-1225.</li>\n<li><strong>APA (2020)</strong>. <em>Publication Manual</em> (7th ed.). 第三章关于结果和讨论的写作规范。</li>\n<li><strong>Lingard, L. (2015)</strong>. Joining a conversation. <em>Perspectives on Medical Education</em>, 4(5), 252-253.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>结果章和讨论章的核心区别在于：结果只呈现&quot;是什么&quot;，讨论则解释&quot;为什么&quot;和&quot;意味着什么&quot;。结果章的写作要客观、规范、完整（包括不显著的发现）；讨论章的写作要有深度，通过与文献的对话、机制解释和边界条件分析来彰显你的学术思考力。诚实而有策略地讨论研究局限，既是学术诚信的要求，也是展示成熟研究素养的机会。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"研究生 学术写作 — 结果与讨论撰写","id":"研究生-学术写作-结果与讨论撰写"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"结果章的写作","id":"结果章的写作"},{"level":4,"text":"量化结果的呈现顺序","id":"量化结果的呈现顺序"},{"level":4,"text":"质性结果的呈现策略","id":"质性结果的呈现策略"},{"level":4,"text":"结果章的常见错误","id":"结果章的常见错误"},{"level":3,"text":"讨论章的写作","id":"讨论章的写作"},{"level":4,"text":"讨论的基本结构","id":"讨论的基本结构"},{"level":4,"text":"与文献对话的策略","id":"与文献对话的策略"},{"level":4,"text":"讨论中的深度分析技巧","id":"讨论中的深度分析技巧"},{"level":4,"text":"研究局限的写作","id":"研究局限的写作"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"研究生 学术写作 — 方法论部分撰写","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/paper-structure/methodology-section"},"next":{"title":"研究生 学术写作 — 期刊论文写作","url":"/l-doc-books/education/graduate/common-foundations/academic-writing/genres/journal-articles"}}